# PlayStation BIOS Directory

Place your PlayStation BIOS files in this directory.

## Required Files
- `SCPH1001.BIN` - US BIOS (recommended)
- `SCPH1000.BIN` - Japanese BIOS  
- `SCPH1002.BIN` - European BIOS

## Legal Notice
You must legally own original PlayStation BIOS files to use them with this emulator.
BIOS files are copyrighted and cannot be distributed with this project.

## File Verification
SCPH1001.BIN should be:
- Size: 524,288 bytes (512 KB)
- MD5: 924e392ed05558ffdb115408c263dccf